1610_p0794a01","n":"0794a","t":"不無二空有不有俗諦亦爾分"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0794b01","n":"0794b","t":"貌故名無相性無生性者一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0794c01","n":"0794c","t":"攝答曰唯如如一法能攝問曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0795a01","n":"0795a","t":"不得生所以者何若執空為有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0795b01","n":"0795b","t":"經七依境者問曰此三性為何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0795c01","n":"0795c","t":"無明若其不淨不即般若此兩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0796a01","n":"0796a","t":"無明而為煩惱所雜故名染濁"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0796b01","n":"0796b","t":"復次佛性一切種相有十義應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0796c01","n":"0796c","t":"故感得如意寶珠得此珠已隨"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0797a01","n":"0797a","t":"瞋為性大悲者以無癡為性二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0797b01","n":"0797b","t":"若略說世間有三種眾生一樂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0797c01","n":"0797c","t":"涅槃時其皆不往後至迦葉集"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0798a01","n":"0798a","t":"為對治此故佛說修習菩薩大"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0798b01","n":"0798b","t":"四無倒何者為四於色等五陰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0798c01","n":"0798c","t":"淨波羅蜜是其果應知由一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0799a01","n":"0799a","t":"習菩薩大悲故於諸眾生常起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0799b01","n":"0799b","t":"依止處而一切煩惱通名無明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0799c01","n":"0799c","t":"故三種意生身滅不更生故苦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0800a01","n":"0800a","t":"槃不如方便謂生死思擇涅槃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0800b01","n":"0800b","t":"能施重可信能說能忍受說深"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0800c01","n":"0800c","t":"善今生五根則不具足便是生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0801a01","n":"0801a","t":"佛性論卷第二佛性論卷第三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0801b01","n":"0801b","t":"日光相似所言滅者即是真智"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0801c01","n":"0801c","t":"思量不能通達故一切眾生言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0802a01","n":"0802a","t":"似能對治一切真見暗障故與"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0802b01","n":"0802b","t":"量智若見一切眾生乖如境智"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0802c01","n":"0802c","t":"名為戒貪著此戒故名為取四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0803a01","n":"0803a","t":"故唯法身獨住四德圓滿故是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0803b01","n":"0803b","t":"故說法身為濟五怖畏七斷六"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0803c01","n":"0803c","t":"計我應生者一切諸見不出有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0804a01","n":"0804a","t":"由天眼因天耳故聞覺觀聲由"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0804b01","n":"0804b","t":"是無故若法現在則非是無更"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0804c01","n":"0804c","t":"此正以出世果報四陰戒等五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0805a01","n":"0805a","t":"願有此滅若有此滅終不能離"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0805b01","n":"0805b","t":"因名而不直取果體自名答曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0805c01","n":"0805c","t":"故涅槃離有離無四謗不及以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0806a01","n":"0806a","t":"性名為凡夫二者能證見佛性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0806b01","n":"0806b","t":"者一不淨位謂眾生界二者淨"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0806c01","n":"0806c","t":"佛性論卷第四天親菩薩造陳"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0807a01","n":"0807a","t":"增長家因者一思惟能成業二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0807b01","n":"0807b","t":"破名為見諦釋曰學道凡夫相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0807c01","n":"0807c","t":"上心煩惱由此四故不淨二由"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0808a01","n":"0808a","t":"如敗衣不堪服用身見真實先"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1610_p0808b01","n":"0808b","t":"取糠中米為譬由此三譬顯諸